Installation
------------

macOS
  - Audio Unit: copy TapeSaturator.component to ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/Components/
  - VST3:       copy TapeSaturator.vst3      to ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3/
  - The builds are not notarized. Remove the quarantine flag once in Terminal:
      xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/Components/TapeSaturator.component
      xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3/TapeSaturator.vst3
  - Restart your DAW (Logic: Plug-in Manager -> Reset & Rescan if needed).

Windows
  - Copy TapeSaturator.vst3 to C:\Program Files\Common Files\VST3\
  - Let your DAW rescan its plugins.


